SUMMARY:Union Samples: Grace Foods
DESCRIPTION:Visit Grace Foods brand at the Bay Kiosk for samples of variety of Grace Food products. \nJoin Grace Foods Canada and Café Santo Domingo at Union Station for a taste of the Caribbean! Stop by to sample refreshing Island Soda and Coconut Water and our New Green Seasoning to name a few from Grace\, alongside rich\, authentic coffee from Café Santo Domingo\, and experience the vibrant flavours that bring people together. \n  \nSampling events are independently operated by third-party brands and agencies. The products being distributed\, sample sizes\, quantities\, giveaway limits\, eligibility requirements\, and event operations are determined solely by the participating brand and may change at the brand’s discretion without notice. \n  \nUnion Station does not control\, manage\, or guarantee the type\, size\, quantity\, quality\, or availability of samples provided. Union Station is not responsible for any changes to the products being distributed or the manner in which they are distributed. Any questions\, concerns\, or feedback regarding a sampling event should be directed to the participating brand. \n  \nSampling hours may vary and events may begin later than scheduled\, pause for breaks\, or conclude early once supplies have been exhausted. Guests are not permitted to queue or wait near the kiosk during non-operating periods. \n  \nWe ask all guests to treat staff\, brand representatives\, and fellow visitors with courtesy and respect. Disruptive\, aggressive\, or inappropriate behaviour may result in refusal of service and denial of participation in the sampling event.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/union-samples-grace-foods-3/
LOCATION:Bay Union Samples Kiosk\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, M5R 1V9\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Samples
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://torontounion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/bay-kiosk.png
END:VEVENT
