SUMMARY:TD Music Tuesdays: Chai and Jam
DESCRIPTION:TD Music Tuesdays at Union Summer\, presented in partnership with TD\, features a diverse and dynamic lineup of artists in collaboration with TD-supported festivals. All June dates highlight artists from the LGBTQ+ community\, celebrating emerging and established voices across the music scene. \nChai and Jam is a collaborative performance project bringing together live music and genre-blending influences\, designed to create an intimate yet energetic mid-day experience at Union Summer. \nStay tuned for additional artist details for this slot.
