SUMMARY:Spotlight on Women: Rayzolution
DESCRIPTION:Rayzalution is an all female reggae band from Toronto. This Band promises not only harmonic music\, but an influential experience you’ll never forget! \nExplore a lineup of women in music with a roster of Toronto’s top female talent. \nCanada Day at Union Summer brings a special edition of Spotlight on Women\, highlighting live performances that celebrate creativity\, diversity\, and local artistry on one of the country’s most important cultural days. \nThis program is in partnership with City Hall Live\, a City of Toronto program that creates paid opportunities for local bands and provides accessible live music experiences for residents and visitors.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/spotlight-on-women-canada-day-special/
