SUMMARY:Canada Day Celebration with DJ DevoDLive and DJ Juice
DESCRIPTION:Canada Day Celebration with DJ DevoDLive and DJ Juice\nGet your party started on the Union Summer patio before your late-night Canada Day celebrations. Grab a drink\, grab a friend and let’s celebrate!
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/global-music-union-summer/
