SUMMARY:Best of Union Beats: DJ Shysofly
DESCRIPTION:We’re bringing our favourite DJs from our indoor Union Beats program to the patio. Turn up your midday with the best beats in the city. Union Summer’s mid-day DJ sessions bring laid-back vibes and feel-good energy to the patio—perfect for a break in the sun. Whether you’re grabbing a bite\, meeting friends\, or just soaking it all in\, our DJs are spinning the ultimate soundtrack to your day. \nDJ Shysofly is an open-format DJ based in Toronto. Rooted in her Eritrean culture and inspired by the city’s diverse music scene\, she creates tailored sets designed to connect with a wide range of audiences and energy levels. \nHer experience spans corporate events\, community gatherings\, athletic showcases\, and brand activations\, reflecting her versatility and strong ability to read and engage any crowd.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/best-of-union-beats-dj-shysofly/
