SUMMARY:Saturday Vibes: K-Pop Dance Party with RPM Dance Crew & DJ Kennessey
DESCRIPTION:Power up your weekend with Saturday Vibes at Union Summer. Ease into your best summer mood with curated DJ sets spinning feel-good tracks\, setting the perfect tone for sun-soaked hangs. It’s all about great music\, easy energy\, and those spontaneous moments that spark connection and get your day going. \nK-Pop Party with RPM Dance Crew brings a high-energy performance-driven experience blending choreography\, music\, and audience interaction. Expect dynamic dance routines\, upbeat K-pop tracks\, and a lively atmosphere designed for all-day summer energy.
