SUMMARY:Brunch & Brass: Mopral Brass Band
DESCRIPTION:Soak up the sunshine as lively brass ensembles fill the patio with rich\, feel-good sounds—perfectly paired with a relaxed midday bite. It’s a laid-back\, joyful way to gather\, unwind\, and let the music carry you through your Sunday. \nMopral Brass Band is a Toronto-based Balkan brass ensemble delivering high-energy\, traditional Trubači-style performances rooted in Serbian musical heritage. Known for their vibrant\, marching-band energy\, they bring an immersive live experience inspired by cultural celebrations and community gatherings. \nTheir repertoire blends traditional Balkan brass\, Klezmer influences\, and New Orleans jazz\, creating a dynamic and celebratory sound designed for live audience engagement.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/brunch-brass-mopral-brass-band/
