SUMMARY:TD Music Tuesdays: Santiago Moa
DESCRIPTION:In partnership with our premier sponsor TD\, Union Summer presents a diverse and dynamic lineup of artists in collaboration with TD-supported festivals. July and August dates feature performers from TD-supported festivals\, highlighting emerging and established talent across genres. \nSantiago Moa is a Colombian singer and songwriter bringing a modern interpretation of salsa to international audiences. His music blends traditional Afro-Cuban rhythms with contemporary electronic elements\, creating a sound that connects classic Latin influences with new-generation energy. \nIn partnership with Salsa in Toronto.
