SUMMARY:Best of Union Beats: TWXLL
DESCRIPTION:We’re bringing our favourite DJs from our indoor Union Beats program to the patio! Turn up your midday with the best beats in the city. \nUnion Summer’s mid-day DJ sessions bring laid-back vibes and feel-good energy to the patio—perfect for a break in the sun. Whether you’re grabbing a bite\, meeting friends\, or just soaking it all in\, our DJs are spinning the ultimate soundtrack to your day. \nTWXLL is an open-format DJ from Scarborough known for his high-energy sets and versatile musical style. Having performed across the GTA and shared stages with a variety of artists\, he seamlessly blends genres including Hip Hop\, Afrobeats\, and Dancehall to create dynamic experiences for every audience. \nBeyond the DJ booth\, TWXLL is a multifaceted creative whose passion for music extends to writing\, event planning\, and community-building. His performances are driven by a love of music and a commitment to bringing people together through sound.
